abstract: >-
  An independent US-equity research platform connecting point-in-time public data,
  factor construction, classical asset-pricing models, constrained portfolio
  analysis, transaction costs, risk analytics, purged walk-forward machine learning,
  and reproducible research delivery.
keywords:
  - empirical asset pricing
  - factor investing
  - point-in-time data
  - portfolio analytics
  - machine learning
  - reproducible research
